# Continue the equilibrated growth configuration and write one frame
# every `stride` steps. `ntrans` transitions need stride*ntrans steps
# after the frame at step 0, which is the equilibrated configuration.
# Thermostat, barostat and step are those of in.equilibrate. The
# restart carries the Nose-Hoover state and the velocities.

variable stride index 10
variable ntrans index 200

units real
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
atom_modify map array

read_restart equil.restart
# sw stores no pair coefficients in a restart, and the Nose-Hoover
# fix is not restored with them. Positions and velocities are.
pair_style sw
pair_coeff * * mW.sw mW
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
fix bath all npt temp 208.0 208.0 1000.0 iso 1.0 1.0 5000.0

timestep 10.0
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp pe press density

reset_timestep 0
variable nsteps equal ${stride}*${ntrans}
dump 1 all custom ${stride} prod.lammpstrj id type x y z
dump_modify 1 sort id
run ${nsteps}
